# Copy this file to .env.local and put your own folder in it.
#
# THE VAULT FOLDER. The inspiration clips. It lives OUTSIDE the repo:
# not one video goes into git. It can be any folder of yours, your
# Obsidian included.
#
# Only Node reads it, and only in development. It carries no VITE_
# prefix on purpose: with that prefix the path on your disk would travel
# into the client bundle.
#
# From inside it only videos and images get served, and nothing that
# starts with a dot. If you point this at your Obsidian, your notes are
# not served.
VAULT_DIR=/Users/vos/donde/tengas/los/clips
